$ mc rm --bypass --version-id 12d5481c-2c63-41bc-90a1-de803e0cbb25 <canary>
    mc: <ERROR> Failed to remove `gf/gf-ai-worm/canary/canary-2026-07-30T15-54-58Z.txt`. Object, 'canary/canary-2026-07-30T15-54-58Z.txt (Version ID=12d5481c-2c63-41bc-90a1-de803e0cbb25)' is WORM protected and cannot be overwritten
PASS  bypass was REFUSED on COMPLIANCE - even root cannot shorten the retention
