E - ATTACK 3: a plain rm with no version id. This SUCCEEDS, and that is fine.
It writes a delete marker. The file looks gone. The locked version is not.
This is the step that fooled me the first time.
    Created delete marker `gf/gf-ai-worm/canary/canary-2026-07-30T15-54-58Z.txt` (versionId=feecedd6-df21-48d1-9621-7f21001eda98).

$ mc ls gf/gf-ai-worm/canary/     # normal listing: looks deleted
    (nothing listed - the delete marker is hiding it)

$ mc ls --versions <canary>                    # version listing: still there
