    [2026-07-30 15:54:59 UTC]    55B STANDARD 12d5481c-2c63-41bc-90a1-de803e0cbb25 v1 PUT canary-2026-07-30T15-54-58Z.txt

$ mc cat --version-id 12d5481c-2c63-41bc-90a1-de803e0cbb25 <canary> | sha256sum
