    original sha256         : a2bcad93b21635586dd33b7c1a8dd805d34407dfb3622dca0cbfd2a88ea04449
PASS  the good bytes are still readable and still verify after that 'successful' delete
PASS  recovered: removed the delete marker and the object is visible again
