F - ATTACK 4: overwrite it with garbage, which is what ransomware really does.
$ mc cat <canary>                       # current version: encrypted
    ENCRYPTED_BY_RANSOMWARE
$ mc cat --version-id 12d5481c-2c63-41bc-90a1-de803e0cbb25 <canary>    # archived version: intact
    canary 2026-07-30T15-54-58Z - these are the good bytes
PASS  the overwrite made a NEW version; the locked good version survived it
